// Setting labels, types, ranges and help for INI Master, which reads this
// resource from the plugin's bytes without loading it. The type must be
// INIMETA. SpeederBike.ini is also the file embed_ini.cmake turns into the
// default the plugin writes on first run, so this is the one copy of that
// text, annotated with ;@ lines, doing both jobs. Keep it in step with
// ReadSettings in core/mod.cpp.

BM_INIMETA INIMETA "../SpeederBike.ini"
